"markdown": "### Laetus\n\nIf you dislike Apple's default keyboard and want a Dark Mode-style look, this is the tweak you need, letting you customize the keyboard on iOS with a much wider range of options.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Laetus/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Laetus/Screenshots/2.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Laetus/Screenshots/3.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
},
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/Laetus/Screenshots/4.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 0,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Supports many different theme styles:**\n  - **Colors:** Change the background color, text color and other colors on the keyboard.\n  - **Images:** Pick any image from your photo library as the keyboard background.\n  - **Image themes:** Ready-made themes built from images and optimized for different screen sizes, delivering a beautiful and complete keyboard theme experience.\n  - **HTML themes:** Themes built with HTML/JavaScript/CSS, creating unique interactive effects or animations.\n  - **Widget themes:** Themes built in Objective-C by iOS developers, offering fully customizable experiences.\n- **Many more keyboard details to customize:**\n  - **Hide key shadows:** Turn off the shadow effect under the keys.\n  - **Hide key labels:** Hide the characters and letters on the keys.\n  - **Change typing effect color:** Customize the gradient of the bubble that pops up when you press a key.\n  - And much more!",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
